 the ICE US Treasury 20+ Year Index. Historical index data from 4/1/2016 through 2/28/2021 is for the 3pm pricing variant of the ICE US Treasury 20+ Year Index. In order to facilitate the transition from the 3pm pricing variant to the 4pm pricing variant, historical index data for 3/1/2021 includes an additional hour of performance from 3-4pm on 2/26/2021, which accounts for 135 basis points of performance, as calculated by the index provider. A basis point is one hundredth of one percent. Historical index data prior to 4/1/2016 is for the Bloomberg U.S. 20+ Year Treasury Bond Index.&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.closingNav&quot;:&quot;Closing NAV&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.dailyLiquiditySeriesLabel&quot;:&quot;Daily Liquidity&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.dailyflows.historicalFlows&quot;:&quot;Historical Flows&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.dailyflows.net&quot;:&quot;$Daily Netflows&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.eightAm&quot;:&quot;NAV: 8:00 AM ET&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.fivePm&quot;:&quot;NAV: 5:00 PM ET&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.fund.infobubble&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.fund.label&quot;:&quot;Fund&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.infobubble&quot;:&quot;The growth of hypothetical $10,000 chart reflects a hypothetical $10,000 investment and assumes reinvestment of dividends and capital gains. Fund expenses, including management fees and other expenses were deducted.&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.level&quot;:&quot;Index Level History&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.liquidity.daily&quot;:&quot;Daily Liquidity&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.liquidity.weekly&quot;:&quot;Weekly Liquidity&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.missingData&quot;:&quot;Performance chart data not available for display.&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.nav&quot;:&quot;Historical NAVs&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.navLabel&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.price&quot;:&quot;Historical Prices&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.priceLabel&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.secBenchmark.infobubble&quot;:&quot;{0} shown for illustrative purposes only to demonstrate how this fund has performed vs. broader respective market.&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.secBenchmark.minVol.infobubble&quot;:&quot;{0} (“Broad Index”) shown for illustrative purposes only to demonstrate how this fund has performed vs. the broader respective market.  The Broad Index weights securities in the index based on float-adjusted market value and generally exhibits higher volatility than the minimum volatility indexes. Minimum volatility indexes utilize a rules-based methodology in an effort to construct a portfolio of lowest absolute volatility. For international exposures, more countries may be represented in the broad index.&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.secBenchmark.multiFact.infobubble&quot;:&quot;{0} (“Broad Index”) shown for illustrative purposes only to demonstrate how this fund has performed vs. the broader respective market.  The Broad Index weights securities in the index based on float-adjusted market value. The Multifactor index utilize a rules-based methodology, weighted to provide a high level of four investment style factors.  For international exposures, more countries may be represented in the Broad Index.&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.strike1&quot;:&quot;NAV 01&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.strike2&quot;:&quot;NAV 02&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.strike3&quot;:&quot;NAV 03&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.strike4&quot;:&quot;NAV 04&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.threePm&quot;:&quot;NAV: 3:00 PM ET&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.tooltip.BENCHAMRK_CONSTRAINT_SRC&quot;:&quot;Constraint Benchmark {0}&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.tooltip.BENCHMARK_COMPARATOR_2_SRC&quot;:&quot;Comparator Benchmark {0}&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.tooltip.BENCHMARK_COMPARATOR_SRC&quot;:&quot;Comparator Benchmark {0}&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.tooltip.BENCHMARK_CONSTRAINT_2_SRC&quot;:&quot;Constraint Benchmark {0}&quot;,&quot;performance.chart.tooltip.BENCHMARK_TARGET_2_S