SEC<!-- --> </span><span class="_ws-lastword-and-tip"><span>Yield</span><span class="_ws-tip-inline"><span class="_ws-info-bubble-container _ws-v3design"><button id="infoBubble-c5b25750-b7e0-4093-afd2-39fda61e4afa" class="_ws-product-info-bubble _ws-v3design" aria-haspopup="true" aria-label="30 Day SEC Yield More Info" aria-expanded="false" data-id="fundamentalsAndRisk-thirtyDaySecYield-infoBubble" webqc-datapoint="fundamentalsAndRisk-thirtyDaySecYield-infoBubble" title="A standard calculation of yield introduced by the SEC in order to provide fairer comparison among funds. This yield reflects the interest earned after deducting the fund&#x27;s expenses during the most recent 30-day period by the average investor in the fund. Negative 30-Day SEC Yield results when accrued expenses of the past 30 days exceed the income collected during the past 30 days."><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g id="Circle-info"><path id="Vector" d="M8 16C10.1217 16 12.1566 15.1571 13.6569 13.6569C15.1571 12.1566 16 10.1217 16 8C16 5.87827 15.1571 3.84344 13.6569 2.34315C12.1566 0.842855 10.1217 0 8 0C5.87827 0 3.84344 0.842855 2.34314 2.34315C0.842853 3.84344 0 5.87827 0 8C0 10.1217 0.842853 12.1566 2.34314 13.6569C3.84344 15.1571 5.87827 16 8 16ZM6.75 10.5H7.5V8.5H6.75H6V7H6.75H8.25H9V7.75V10.5H9.25H10V12H9.25H6.75H6V10.5H6.75ZM9 6H7V4H9V6Z" fill="black"></path></g></svg></button></span></span></span></span></div><div class="_ws-pp-card-value-group" aria-label="5.29% as of Oct 30, 2026"><div class="_ws-pp-card-item" aria-hidden="true"><span class="_ws-oneds-body-l-bold" data-id="fundamentalsAndRisk-thirtyDaySecYield-data" webqc-datapoint="fundamentalsAndRisk-thirtyDaySecYield">5.29%</span></div><div class="_ws-pp-card-item _ws-asOfDate _ws-oneds-body-xs-compact" webqc-datapoint="fundamentalsAndRisk-thirtyDaySecYield-asOf" data-id="fundamentalsAndRisk-thirtyDaySecYield-asOf" aria-hidden="true">as of Oct 30, 2026</div></div></di