t 4:00 PM ET (when NAV is normally determined for most funds).&quot;,&quot;Index: {0}. On 12/1/2023 TLT began to track the standard pricing variant of the ICE US Treasury 20+ Year Bond Index, which now utilizes 4pm as its pricing time (previously it was 3pm) and resulted in a discontinuation of the 4pm pricing variant. Historical index data from 3/1/2021 to 11/30/2023 is for the 4pm pricing variant of the ICE US Treasury 20+ Year Index. Historical index data from 4/1/2016 through 2/28/2021 is for the 3pm pricing variant of the ICE US Treasury 20+ Year Index. In order to facilitate the transition from the 3pm pricing variant to the 4pm pricing variant, historical index data for 3/1/2021 includes an additional hour of performance from 3-4pm on 2/26/2021, which accounts for 135 basis points of performance, as calculated by the index provider. A basis point is one hundredth of one percent. Historical index data prior to 4/1/2016 is for the Bloomberg U.S. 20+ Year Treasury Bond Index.&quot;],&quot;prefix&quot;:null,&quot;value&quot;:[&quot;annualNav&quot;,&quot;annualMarketPrice&quot;,&quot;benchmarkAnnual&quot;]},&quot;returnsByCurrency&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;returnsByCurrency&quot;,&quot;fullName&quot;:&quot;performance.returnsByCurrency&quot;,&quot;visible&quot;:true,&quot;active&quot;:false,&quot;sortOrder&quot;:null,&quot;asOfDate&quot;:null,&quot;formattedAsOfDate&quot;:null,&quot;formattedValue&quot;:&quot;-&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;infoBubble&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;prefix&quot;:null,&quot;value&quot;:null},&quot;secondaryBenchmarkName&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;secondaryBenchmarkName&quot;,&quot;fullName&quot;:&quot;performance.secondaryBenchmarkName&quot;,&quot;visible&quot;:true,&quot;active&quot;:false,&quot;sortOrder&quot;:null,&quot;asOfDate&quot;:null,&quot;formattedAsOfDate&quot;:null,&quot;formattedValue&quot;:&quot;-&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;infoBubble&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;prefix&quot;:null,&quot;value&