 is open."><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g id="Circle-info"><path id="Vector" d="M8 16C10.1217 16 12.1566 15.1571 13.6569 13.6569C15.1571 12.1566 16 10.1217 16 8C16 5.87827 15.1571 3.84344 13.6569 2.34315C12.1566 0.842855 10.1217 0 8 0C5.87827 0 3.84344 0.842855 2.34314 2.34315C0.842853 3.84344 0 5.87827 0 8C0 10.1217 0.842853 12.1566 2.34314 13.6569C3.84344 15.1571 5.87827 16 8 16ZM6.75 10.5H7.5V8.5H6.75H6V7H6.75H8.25H9V7.75V10.5H9.25H10V12H9.25H6.75H6V10.5H6.75ZM9 6H7V4H9V6Z" fill="black"></path></g></svg></button></span></span></div></th></tr><tr data-id="performance.premium-discount-chart-row-Discount"><th scope="row"><div class="_ws-row-header _ws-oneds-body-s-compact-bold _ws-Discount"><span data-id="performance.premium-discount-chart-Discount-label">Discount</span><span class="_ws-row-header-infobubble"><span class="_ws-info-bubble-container _ws-v3design"><button id="infoBubble-93e1030e-5831-42be-94be-6e512832bbc5" class="_ws-product-info-bubble _ws-v3design" aria-haspopup="true" aria-label="More Info: " aria-expanded="false" data-id="performance.premium-discount-chart-Discount-infoBubble" webqc-datapoint="performance.premium-discount-chart-Discount-infoBubble" title="Number of trading days the ETF’s closing price is below the NAV."><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g id="Circle-info"><path id="Vector" d="M8 16C10.1217 16 12.1566 15.1571 13.6569 13.6569C15.1571 12.1566 16 10.1217 16 8C16 5.87827 15.1571 3.84344 13.6569 2.34315C12.1566 0.842855 10.1217 0 8 0C5.87827 0 3.84344 0.842855 2.34314 2.34315C0.842853 3.84344 0 5.87827 0 8C0 10.1217 0.842853 12.1566 2.34314 13.6569C3.84344 15.1571 5.87827 16 8 16ZM6.75 10.5H7.5V8.5H6.75H6V7H6.75H8.25H9V7.75V10.5H9.25H10V12H9.25H6.75H6V10.5H6.75ZM9 6H7V4H9V6Z" fill="black"></path></g></svg></button></span></span></div></th></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="_ws-axis-table-scroll-side"><div 