ld receive if you traded shares at other times.&lt;/em&gt;&quot;}],&quot;audience-message-insti&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;strong&gt;This document is marketing material. For Investors in the UK. Defined Contribution. THIS DOCUMENT IS FOR PROFESSIONAL INVESTORS ONLY AND SHOULD NOT BE SHARED WITH, DISTRIBUTED TO, OR RELIED UPON BY, RETAIL INVESTORS.&lt;/strong&gt;&quot;}],&quot;audience-message-insti-dc&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;strong&gt;This document is marketing material. For Investors in the UK. Defined Contribution. THIS DOCUMENT IS FOR PROFESSIONAL INVESTORS ONLY AND SHOULD NOT BE SHARED WITH, DISTRIBUTED TO, OR RELIED UPON BY, RETAIL INVESTORS.&lt;/strong&gt;&quot;}],&quot;benchmark-breakdowns.disclaimer&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The Breakdowns shown here represent those of the Benchmark Index.&quot;}],&quot;cci-iop-esg-policy-header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;ESG POLICY&quot;}],&quot;cci-iop-index-desc-header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;BENCHMARK DESCRIPTION&quot;}],&quot;cci-iop-invt-objective-header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;INVESTMENT OBJECTIVE&quot;}],&quot;cci-iop-invt-policy-header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;INVESTMENT POLICY&quot;}],&quot;cci-iop-invt-policy-maininvest-header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Main investments:&quot;}],&quot;cci-iop-invt-policy-otherinvest-heading&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Other investments:&quot;}],&quot;cci-iop-main-header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Investment objective and policy&quot;}],&quot;cci.fundoverview.header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;What does the Fund do?&quot;}],&quot;cci.fundoverview.iopfootnote&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Please read the full Investment Objective and Policy section below.&quot;}],&quot;cci.fundoverview.iopsummarybullets&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;cci.fundoverview.iopsummarybullets:paragraph1cci.fundoverview.iopsummarybullets:paragraph1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;cci.fundoverview.iopsummarybullets:paragraph2cci.fundoverview.iopsummarybullets:paragraph2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;cci.fundoverview.iopsummarybullets:paragraph3cci.fundoverview.iopsummarybullets:paragraph3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;cci.fundoverview.iopsummarybullets:paragraph4cci.fundoverview.iopsummarybullets:paragraph4&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;cci.fundoverview.iopsummarybullets:paragraph5cci.fundoverview.iopsummarybullets:paragraph5&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;}],&quot;cci.header.investordisclosure&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;strong&gt;This product summary is for UK investors.&lt;/strong&gt; It gives you important information to help you decide whether an investment in this product is right for you. Your decision should depend on your investment goals, finances, risk appetite and tax position. You may wish to seek financial or tax advice if you are unsure whether this investment is right for you. Where a prospectus is available for this product, you should read this product summary together with the prospectus. Please see the Additional Information section below for more information.&quot;}],&quot;cci.header.isin&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;(ISIN: US4642874329)&quot;}],&quot;cci.header.keyfactsclass&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;CLASS SPECIFIC INFORM